 "_about": "The state hash (casa_tool.state_hash) the standard-mode sim service logs when a fresh episode starts (episode.jsonl, ev start), per frozen instance: the hash logged by the archived standard and standard-realtime episodes of the RoboCasa series (jobs/, 2026-10-02 .. 2026-10-17, every runner host; `episodes` counts this benchmark's current runs; with the superseded runs, 776 episodes of 102 tasks, every episode of a task logged the same hash; board 0151). The generator writes it into the sim service's environment (RCB_START_SHA): a fresh episode that does not start in this state is refused as instance_mismatch, an infrastructure failure. An instance without an entry is checked by its file's hash only (RCB_INSTANCE_SHA). Re-record it whenever the image or casa_tool changes how a scene is built (import_references.py records start_state_sha for a newly imported instance).",
